"Import the asset as linked data-block, and pack it in the current file "
"(ensures that it remains unchanged in case the library data is modified, is "
"not available anymore, etc.)"
msgstr "將資產作為關聯資料塊匯入，並將其打包到當前檔案中（確保在庫資料被修改或不再可用等情況時，其內容保持不變）"

