#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyRotationConstraint.mix_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.mix_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryAttributeConstraint.mix_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.DataTransferModifier.mix_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.NormalEditModifier.mix_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.VertexWeightMixModifier.mix_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.OBJECT_OT_data_transfer.mix_mode
msgid "Mix Mode"
msgstr "混合模式"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode
msgid ""
"Specify how existing transformations and the action channels are combined"
msgstr "指定現有變換和動作通道的組合方式"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'REPLACE'
msgid "Replace the original transformation with the action channels"
msgstr "使用動作通道替換原始變換"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE_FULL'
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE_FULL'
#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryAttributeConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE_FULL'
msgid "Before Original (Full)"
msgstr "初始前 (完整)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE_FULL'
msgid ""
"Apply the action channels before the original transformation, as if applied "
"to an imaginary parent in Full Inherit Scale mode. Will create shear when "
"combining rotation and non-uniform scale."
msgstr "在初始變換之前應用動作通道，就好像在完整繼承縮放模式下應用於假想的父級一樣。將旋轉和不均勻縮放組合時將建立切變。"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE'
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE'
msgid "Before Original (Aligned)"
msgstr "初始前 (對齊)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE'
msgid ""
"Apply the action channels before the original transformation, as if applied "
"to an imaginary parent in Aligned Inherit Scale mode. This effectively uses "
"Full for location and Split Channels for rotation and scale."
msgstr "在初始變換之前應用動作通道，就好像應用於對齊繼承縮放模式中的假想父級一樣。這有效地使用完全的位置和拆分通道的旋轉和縮放。"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE_SPLIT'
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE_SPLIT'
#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryAttributeConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE_SPLIT'
msgid "Before Original (Split Channels)"
msgstr "初始前 (拆分通道)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'BEFORE_SPLIT'
msgid ""
"Apply the action channels before the original transformation, handling "
"location, rotation and scale separately"
msgstr "在初始變換前應用動作通道，分開處理位置、旋轉和縮放"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER_FULL'
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER_FULL'
#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryAttributeConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER_FULL'
msgid "After Original (Full)"
msgstr "初始後 (完整)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER_FULL'
msgid ""
"Apply the action channels after the original transformation, as if applied "
"to an imaginary child in Full Inherit Scale mode. Will create shear when "
"combining rotation and non-uniform scale."
msgstr "在初始變換後應用動作通道，就像應用於具有完整繼承縮放的假想子級一樣。將旋轉和不均勻縮放組合時將建立切變。"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER'
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER'
msgid "After Original (Aligned)"
msgstr "初始後 (對齊)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER'
msgid ""
"Apply the action channels after the original transformation, as if applied "
"to an imaginary child in Aligned Inherit Scale mode. This effectively uses "
"Full for location and Split Channels for rotation and scale."
msgstr "在初始變換後應用動作通道，就好像應用於處於對齊繼承縮放模式的假想子級一樣。這有效地使用完整的位置和拆分通道的旋轉和縮放。"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER_SPLIT'
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER_SPLIT'
#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryAttributeConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER_SPLIT'
msgid "After Original (Split Channels)"
msgstr "初始後 (拆分通道)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.mix_mode:'AFTER_SPLIT'
msgid ""
"Apply the action channels after the original transformation, handling "
"location, rotation and scale separately"
msgstr "在初始變換後應用動作通道，分開處理位置、旋轉和縮放"

