#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_force_widget_update
msgid "Overwrite Widgets"
msgstr "覆蓋小部件"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_force_widget_update
msgid ""
"Forces Rigify to delete and rebuild all of the generated widget objects. If "
"disabled, widgets that already exist when regenerating will not be replaced "
"to facilitate manual editing"
msgstr "強制 Rigify 刪除並重建所有生成的部件物體。如果禁用，在重新生成時已存在的部件將不會被替換，以便於手動編輯"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_mirror_widgets
msgid "Mirror Widgets"
msgstr "映象小部件"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_mirror_widgets
msgid ""
"Generate symmetrical left/right widgets as linked duplicates. Widgets on the"
" Right side will be scaled by -1 on the x axis"
msgstr "將左右對稱的小部件生成為關聯副本。右側部件將在 x 軸上按 -1 的比例進行縮放"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_rig_basename
msgid "Rigify Rig Name"
msgstr "Rigify 繫結名稱"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_rig_basename
msgid ""
"If specified, this name will be used for the newly generated armature "
"object, widget collection and script. Otherwise, a name is generated based "
"on the name of the metarig object by either replacing... - 'metarig' with "
"'rig'- 'META' with 'RIG'- or prefixing with 'RIG-' When updating an already "
"generated rig its name is never changed"
msgstr ""
"如果指定了名稱，則會將其用於新生成的骨架物體、部件集合與指令碼。否則，系統將根據元骨骼物體的名稱生成名稱，具體方式是將... - 'metarig' "
"替換為 'rig'- 將 'META' 替換為 'RIG'- 或在名稱前新增字首 'RIG-'．更新已生成的骨骼時，其名稱絕不會被更改"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_rig_ui
msgid "Rigify Target Rig UI"
msgstr "Rigify 目標繫結 UI"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_rig_ui
msgid ""
"Defines the text data-block to overwrite. If unset, a new one will be "
"created and named based on the name of the rig"
msgstr "定義要覆蓋的文字資料塊，如果未設定，將建立一個新的，並根據繫結的名稱進行命名"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_target_rig
msgid "Rigify Target Rig"
msgstr "Rigify 目標繫結"

#. :src: bpy.types.Armature.rigify_target_rig
msgid ""
"Defines which armature object to overwrite. If unset, a new one will be "
"created with a name based on the Rig Name option or the name of the metarig"
msgstr "定義要覆蓋的骨架物體。如果未設定，將建立一個新的繫結，其名稱基於繫結名稱選項或元骨骼的名稱"

