msgstr "使用彈性變形修改整個網格"

#. :src: bpy.types.Brush.spacing
msgid "Spacing between brush daubs as a percentage of brush diameter"
msgstr "將筆刷塗料間距作為筆刷直徑的百分比率"

#. :src: bpy.types.Brush.stabilize_normal
msgid "Stabilize Normal"
msgstr "穩定法向"

#. :src: bpy.types.Brush.stabilize_normal
msgid ""
"How stable the plane normal is over the course of the stroke. A value of 0 "
"corresponds to using the current normal, and a value of 1 corresponds to "
"using the initial normal."
msgstr "在運筆過程中，平面法線的穩定程度。取值為 0 表示使用當前法線，取值為 1 表示使用初始法線。"

#. :src: bpy.types.Brush.stabilize_plane
msgid "Stabilize Center"
msgstr "穩定中心"

#. :src: bpy.types.Brush.stabilize_plane
msgid ""
"How stable the plane center is over the course of the stroke. A value of 0 "
"corresponds to using the current center, and a value of 1 corresponds to "
"using the initial center."
msgstr "在運筆過程中，平面中心的穩定程度。取值為 0 表示使用當前中心，取值為 1 表示使用初始中心。"

#. :src: bpy.types.Brush.stencil_dimension
msgid "Stencil Dimensions"
msgstr "鏤版尺寸"

#. :src: bpy.types.Brush.stencil_dimension
msgid "Dimensions of stencil in viewport"
msgstr "鏤版在檢視中的尺寸"

