msgid "Time Alignment"
msgstr "時間對齊"

#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilBuildModifier.concurrent_time_alignment
msgid "How should strokes start to appear/disappear"
msgstr "筆畫應該如何開始出現/消失"

