msgid "All strokes start at same time (i.e. short strokes finish earlier)"
msgstr "所有筆畫開始於相同時間 (比如, 短筆畫完成得較早)"

#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilBuildModifier.concurrent_time_alignment:'END'
msgid "Align End"
msgstr "對齊終點"

