msgid "Grow"
msgstr "生長"

#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilBuildModifier.transition:'GROW'
msgid ""
"Show points in the order they occur in each stroke (e.g. for animating lines"
" being drawn)"
msgstr "顯示每個筆畫中出現的點的順序 (例如: 用於繪製的動畫線)"

#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilBuildModifier.transition:'SHRINK'
msgid ""
"Hide points from the end of each stroke to the start (e.g. for animating "
"lines being erased)"
msgstr "從各筆畫的終點隱藏點到起點 (比如用於模擬擦除線條的效果)"

#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilBuildModifier.transition:'FADE'
msgid "Vanish"
msgstr "消失"

#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilBuildModifier.transition:'FADE'
msgid ""
"Hide points in the order they occur in each stroke (e.g. for animating ink "
