#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridAdvect
msgid "Advect Grid"
msgstr "平流柵格"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridAdvect
msgid ""
"Move grid values through a velocity field using numerical integration. "
"Supports multiple integration schemes for different accuracy and performance"
" trade-offs"
msgstr "透過數值積分方法，讓柵格值在一個速度場中移動。該功能支援多種積分方案，以滿足不同的精度和效能權衡需求"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridClip
msgid "Clip Grid"
msgstr "裁切柵格"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridClip
msgid ""
"Deactivate grid voxels outside minimum and maximum coordinates, setting them"
" to the background value."
msgstr "把最小和最大座標範圍外的柵格體素設為非啟用狀態，將其值設為背景值。"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridCurl
msgid "Grid Curl"
msgstr "柵格旋度"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridCurl
msgid ""
"Calculate the magnitude and direction of circulation of a directional vector"
" grid"
msgstr "計算一個方向向量柵格的環量大小和方向"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridDeactivateVoxels
msgid "Deactivate Voxels"
msgstr "停用體素"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridDeactivateVoxels
msgid "Deactivate selected voxels and tiles"
msgstr "停用所選體素和分塊"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridDilateAndErode
msgid "Grid Dilate & Erode"
msgstr "柵格膨脹和腐蝕"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridDilateAndErode
msgid ""
"Dilate or erode the active regions of a grid. This changes which voxels are "
"active but does not change their values."
msgstr "膨脹或腐蝕柵格的活動區域。這會改變哪些體素處於活動狀態，但不會改變它們的值。"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridDivergence
msgid "Grid Divergence"
msgstr "柵格散度"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridDivergence
msgid ""
"Calculate the flow into and out of each point of a directional vector grid"
msgstr "計算方向向量柵格中每個點的流入量和流出量"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridGradient
msgid "Grid Gradient"
msgstr "柵格梯度"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridGradient
msgid ""
"Calculate the direction and magnitude of the change in values of a scalar "
"grid"
msgstr "計算標量柵格數值變化的方向與幅度"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridInfo
msgid "Grid Info"
msgstr "柵格資訊"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridInfo
msgid "Retrieve information about a volume grid"
msgstr "檢索體積柵格的相關資訊"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridLaplacian
msgid "Grid Laplacian"
msgstr "柵格拉普拉斯"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridLaplacian
msgid "Compute the divergence of the gradient of the input grid"
msgstr "計算輸入柵格梯度漸變的散度"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridMean
msgid "Grid Mean"
msgstr "柵格平均值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridMean
msgid ""
"Apply mean (box) filter smoothing to a voxel. The mean value from "
"surrounding voxels in a box-shape defined by the radius replaces the voxel "
"value."
msgstr "對體素應用均值（方框）過濾平滑。此操作以指定的半徑定義一個方框範圍，將範圍內所有周圍體素的平均值取代當前體素的數值。"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridMedian
msgid "Grid Median"
msgstr "柵格中值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridMedian
msgid ""
"Apply median (box) filter smoothing to a voxel. The median value from "
"surrounding voxels in a box-shape defined by the radius replaces the voxel "
"value."
msgstr "對體素應用中值（方框）過濾平滑。此操作以指定的半徑定義一個方框範圍，將範圍內所有周圍體素的中位數值取代當前體素的數值。"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridPrune
msgid "Prune Grid"
msgstr "精簡柵格"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridPrune
msgid ""
"Make the storage of a volume grid more efficient by collapsing data into "
"tiles or inner nodes"
msgstr "透過將資料合併到塊或內部節點中，使體積柵格的儲存更高效"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridSolvePoisson
msgid "Grid Solve Poisson"
msgstr ""

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridSolvePoisson
msgid ""
"Solve the Poisson equation for a scalar field. Computes a grid whose "
"Laplacian equals the input scalar grid."
msgstr ""

