msgstr "柵格拓撲布林"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridTopologyBoolean
msgid "Combine the topology of multiple grids"
msgstr "合併多個柵格的拓撲結構"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridVoxelize
msgid "Voxelize Grid"
msgstr "體素化柵格"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeGridVoxelize
msgid ""
"Remove sparseness from a volume grid by making the active tiles into voxels"
msgstr "透過將活動塊轉換為體素，使體積柵格不再稀疏"

