"Cast rays from the context geometry onto a target geometry, and retrieve "
"information from each hit point"
msgstr "將光線從上下文幾何體投射到目標幾何體上，並從每個命中點檢索資訊"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRealizeInstances
#. :src: Socket name from node group Array, file
#. geometry_nodes_essentials.blend
#. :src: Socket name from node group Instance on Elements, file
#. geometry_nodes_essentials.blend
#. :src: Socket name from node group Scatter on Surface, file
#. geometry_nodes_essentials.blend
msgid "Realize Instances"
msgstr "實現例項"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRealizeInstances
msgid "Convert instances into real geometry data"
msgstr "將例項轉換為真實的幾何資料"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRealizeInstances.realize_to_point_domain
msgid "Realize to Point Domain"
msgstr "實現至點域"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRealizeInstances.realize_to_point_domain
msgid ""
"Propagate instance attributes to the point domain rather than the curve "
"domain. This property exists for compatibility with 5.0 and earlier."
msgstr "將例項屬性傳播至點域而非曲線域。此屬性為相容5.0及更早版本而存在。"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRemoveAttribute
msgid "Remove Named Attribute"
msgstr "刪除已命名屬性"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRemoveAttribute
msgid ""
"Delete an attribute with a specified name from a geometry. Typically used to"
" optimize performance"
msgstr "從幾何體中刪除具有指定名稱的屬性。通常用於最佳化效能"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRenameAttribute
msgid "Rename Attribute"
msgstr "重新命名屬性"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRenameAttribute
msgid "Change the name of an attribute"
msgstr "更改屬性的名稱"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRepeatInput
msgid "Repeat Input"
msgstr "重複輸入"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRepeatOutput
msgid "Repeat Output"
msgstr "重複輸出"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeReplaceMaterial
msgid "Replace Material"
msgstr "替換材質"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeReplaceMaterial
msgid "Swap one material with another"
msgstr "用另一種材質代替一種材質"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeResampleCurve
msgid "Resample Curve"
msgstr "重取樣曲線"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeResampleCurve
msgid "Generate a poly spline for each input spline"
msgstr "為每個輸入樣條生成多段式樣條"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeResampleCurve.keep_last_segment
msgid "Keep Last Segment"
msgstr "保留最後一段"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeResampleCurve.keep_last_segment
msgid ""
"Do not collapse curves to single points if they are shorter than the given "
"length. The collapsing behavior exists for compatibility reasons."
msgstr "如果它們的長度小於給定值，不要將曲線塌陷成單點。塌陷行為的存在是為了相容性。"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeReverseCurve
msgid "Reverse Curve"
msgstr "反轉曲線"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeReverseCurve
msgid "Change the direction of curves by swapping their start and end data"
msgstr "透過交換曲線的開始和結束資料來更改曲線的方向"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRotateInstances
msgid "Rotate Instances"
msgstr "旋轉例項"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeRotateInstances
msgid "Rotate geometry instances in local or global space"
msgstr "在區域性或全域性空間中旋轉幾何例項"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridBoolean
msgid "SDF Grid Boolean"
msgstr "SDF柵格布林"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridBoolean
msgid "Cut, subtract, or join multiple SDF volume grid inputs"
msgstr "切割、減去或合併多個SDF體積柵格輸入項"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridBoolean.operation:'INTERSECT'
msgid "Keep the part of the grids that is common between all operands"
msgstr "保留所有運算物件之間共有的柵格部分"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridBoolean.operation:'UNION'
msgid "Combine grids in an additive way"
msgstr "以增添方式組合柵格"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridBoolean.operation:'DIFFERENCE'
msgid "Combine grids in a subtractive way"
msgstr "以減去方式組合柵格"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridFillet
msgid "SDF Grid Fillet"
msgstr "SDF柵格圓角"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridFillet
msgid ""
"Round off concave internal corners in a signed distance field. Only affects "
"areas with negative principal curvature, creating smoother transitions "
"between surfaces"
msgstr "在帶符號距離場中圓化凹陷的內角。僅影響負主曲率區域，實現表面間更平滑的過渡"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridLaplacian
msgid "SDF Grid Laplacian"
msgstr "SDF柵格拉普拉斯"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridLaplacian
msgid ""
"Apply Laplacian flow smoothing to a signed distance field. Computationally "
"efficient alternative to mean curvature flow, ideal when combined with SDF "
"normalization"
msgstr "對有符號距離場應用拉普拉斯流平滑。作為平均曲率流的高效替代方案，與SDF規格化結合使用時效果尤佳"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridMean
msgid "SDF Grid Mean"
msgstr "SDF柵格平均值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridMean
msgid ""
"Apply mean (box) filter smoothing to a signed distance field. Fast separable"
" averaging filter for general smoothing of the distance field"
msgstr "對有符號距離場應用均值（方盒）濾波平滑處理。用於距離場通用平滑處理的快速可分離平均濾波器"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridMeanCurvature
msgid "SDF Grid Mean Curvature"
msgstr "SDF柵格平均曲率"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridMeanCurvature
msgid ""
"Apply mean curvature flow smoothing to a signed distance field. Evolves the "
"surface based on its mean curvature, naturally smoothing high-curvature "
"regions more than flat areas"
msgstr "對有符號距離場應用平均曲率流平滑處理。該過程基於表面的平均曲率進行演化，使高曲率區域比平坦區域獲得更顯著的平滑效果"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridMedian
msgid "SDF Grid Median"
msgstr "SDF柵格中值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridMedian
msgid ""
"Apply median filter to a signed distance field. Reduces noise while "
"preserving sharp features and edges in the distance field"
msgstr "對有符號距離場應用中值濾波。在減少噪聲的同時，保留距離場中的銳利特徵和邊緣"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridOffset
msgid "SDF Grid Offset"
msgstr "SDF柵格偏移"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSDFGridOffset
msgid ""
"Offset a signed distance field surface by a world-space distance. Dilates "
"(positive) or erodes (negative) while maintaining the signed distance "
"property"
msgstr "透過世界空間距離偏移有符號距離場表面。在保持有符號距離特性的同時，進行膨脹（正向）或侵蝕（負向）操作"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleCurve
msgid "Sample Curve"
msgstr "取樣曲線"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleCurve
msgid ""
"Retrieve data from a point on a curve at a certain distance from its start"
msgstr "從曲線上距起點一定距離的點檢索資料"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleCurve.mode
msgid "Method for sampling input"
msgstr "取樣輸入方法"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleCurve.mode:'FACTOR'
msgid "Find sample positions on the curve using a factor of its total length"
msgstr "使用總長度的一個係數查詢曲線上的取樣位置"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleCurve.mode:'LENGTH'
msgid "Find sample positions on the curve using a distance from its beginning"
msgstr "使用到曲線起點的距離查詢曲線上的取樣位置"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleCurve.use_all_curves
msgid "All Curves"
msgstr "所有曲線"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleCurve.use_all_curves
msgid ""
"Sample lengths based on the total length of all curves, rather than using a "
"length inside each selected curve"
msgstr "基於所有曲線總長度的取樣長度，而非使用每個選定曲線內的長度"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleGrid
msgid "Sample Grid"
msgstr "取樣柵格"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleGrid
msgid "Retrieve values from the specified volume grid"
msgstr "檢索指定體積柵格中的值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleGridIndex
msgid "Sample Grid Index"
msgstr "取樣柵格編號"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleGridIndex
msgid "Retrieve volume grid values at specific voxels"
msgstr "在特定體素檢索體積柵格的值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleIndex
msgid "Retrieve values from specific geometry elements"
msgstr "從特定幾何元素中檢索值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleIndex.clamp
msgid ""
"Clamp the indices to the size of the attribute domain instead of outputting "
"a default value for invalid indices"
msgstr "鉗制編號為屬性域的大小，而非輸出可能無效的預設值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleNearest
msgid "Sample Nearest"
msgstr "取樣最近"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleNearest
msgid ""
"Find the element of a geometry closest to a position. Similar to the \"Index"
" of Nearest\" node"
msgstr "查詢最接近某個位置的幾何元素，類似於 “最近編號” 節點"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleNearestSurface
msgid "Sample Nearest Surface"
msgstr "取樣最近的表面"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleNearestSurface
msgid ""
"Calculate the interpolated value of a mesh attribute on the closest point of"
" its surface"
msgstr "計算網格屬性在其表面最近點上的插值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleSoundFrequencies
msgid "Sample Sound Frequencies"
msgstr "取樣聲音訊率"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleSoundFrequencies
msgid ""
"Retrieve the amplitude from a sound data-block of a frequency range at a "
"given time"
msgstr "從特定時間點某個頻率範圍的聲音資料塊中提取振幅"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleUVSurface
msgid "Sample UV Surface"
msgstr "取樣UV表面"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSampleUVSurface
msgid ""
"Calculate the interpolated values of a mesh attribute at a UV coordinate"
msgstr "計算 UV 座標處網格屬性的插值"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeScaleElements
msgid "Scale Elements"
msgstr "縮放元素"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeScaleElements
msgid "Scale groups of connected edges and faces"
msgstr "縮放連線邊和麵的組"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeScaleElements.domain
msgid "Element type to transform"
msgstr "要變換的元素型別"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeScaleElements.domain:'FACE'
msgid "Scale individual faces or neighboring face islands"
msgstr "縮放單個面或相鄰面孤島"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeScaleElements.domain:'EDGE'
msgid "Scale individual edges or neighboring edge islands"
msgstr "縮放單條邊或相鄰邊孤島"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeScaleInstances
msgid "Scale Instances"
msgstr "縮放例項"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeScaleInstances
msgid "Scale geometry instances in local or global space"
msgstr "在區域性或全域性空間中縮放幾何例項"

#. :src: bpy.types.GeometryNodeSelfObject
#. :src: bpy.types.NodeTreeInterfaceSocket.default_input:'SELF_OBJECT'
#: source/blender/editors/space_node/node_socket_tooltip.cc:972
