msgstr "選擇您喜歡的顏色，著色器將估計吸收係數來算繪相似的毛髮"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfMetallic
msgid "Metallic BSDF"
msgstr "金屬 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfMetallic
msgid "Metallic reflection with microfacet distribution, and metallic fresnel"
msgstr "具有微表面分佈的金屬反射和金屬菲涅爾"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfMetallic.fresnel_type
msgid "Fresnel Type"
msgstr "菲涅爾型別"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfMetallic.fresnel_type
msgid "Fresnel method used to tint the metal"
msgstr "用於金屬染色的菲涅爾方法"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfMetallic.fresnel_type:'PHYSICAL_CONDUCTOR'
msgid "Physical Conductor"
msgstr "物理導體"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfMetallic.fresnel_type:'PHYSICAL_CONDUCTOR'
msgid ""
"Fresnel conductor based on the complex refractive index per color channel"
msgstr "基於每個顏色通道複合折射率的菲涅爾導體"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfMetallic.fresnel_type:'F82'
msgid "F82 Tint"
msgstr "F82 色調"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfMetallic.fresnel_type:'F82'
msgid ""
"An approximation of the Fresnel conductor curve based on the colors at "
"perpendicular and near-grazing (roughly 82°) angles"
msgstr "基於垂直和近掠射角（約82°）顏色的菲涅爾導體曲線近似值"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled
msgid "Principled BSDF"
msgstr "原理化 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled
msgid ""
"Physically-based, easy-to-use shader for rendering surface materials, based "
"on the OpenPBR model"
msgstr "基於物理的、易於使用的著色器，用於算繪表面材質，基於OpenPBR模型"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method
msgid "Subsurface Method"
msgstr "次表面方法"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff
msgid "Method for rendering subsurface scattering"
msgstr "用於算繪次表面散射(SSS)的方法"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method:'BURLEY'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff:'BURLEY'
msgid "Christensen-Burley"
msgstr "克里斯坦森-伯利"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method:'BURLEY'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff:'BURLEY'
msgid "Approximation to physically based volume scattering"
msgstr "基於物理的體積散射的近似值"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method:'RANDOM_WALK'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff:'RANDOM_WALK'
msgid "Random Walk"
msgstr "隨機遊走"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method:'RANDOM_WALK'
#. :src:
#. bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method:'RANDOM_WALK_LEGACY'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff:'RANDOM_WALK'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff:'RANDOM_WALK_LEGACY'
msgid ""
"Volumetric approximation to physically based volume scattering, using the "
"scattering radius as specified"
msgstr "使用指定的散射半徑，對基於物理的體積散射進行體積近似處理"

#. :src:
#. bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method:'RANDOM_WALK_SKIN'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff:'RANDOM_WALK_SKIN'
msgid "Random Walk (Skin)"
msgstr "隨機遊走 (皮膚)"

#. :src:
#. bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method:'RANDOM_WALK_SKIN'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff:'RANDOM_WALK_SKIN'
msgid ""
"Volumetric approximation to physically based volume scattering, with "
"scattering radius automatically adjusted to match color textures. Designed "
"for skin shading."
msgstr "基於物理體積散射的體積近似方法，其散射半徑可自動調整以匹配色彩紋理。專為皮膚著色設計。"

#. :src:
#. bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled.subsurface_method:'RANDOM_WALK_LEGACY'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeSubsurfaceScattering.falloff:'RANDOM_WALK_LEGACY'
msgid "Random Walk (Legacy)"
msgstr "隨機遊走 (舊版)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfRayPortal
msgid "Ray Portal BSDF"
msgstr "光線傳送 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfRayPortal
msgid "Continue tracing from an arbitrary new position and in a new direction"
msgstr "從任意新的位置和新的方向繼續光線追蹤"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfRefraction
msgid "Refraction BSDF"
msgstr "折射 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfRefraction
msgid ""
"Glossy refraction with sharp or microfacet distribution, typically used for "
"materials that transmit light"
msgstr "具有銳利或微有面元分佈的光面折射，通常用於透光的材質"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfSheen
msgid "Sheen BSDF"
msgstr "邊緣光澤 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfSheen
msgid ""
"Reflection for materials such as cloth.\n"
"Typically mixed with other shaders (such as a Diffuse Shader) and is not particularly useful on its own"
msgstr ""
"布料等材質的反射。\n"
"通常與其他著色器（如漫反射著色器）混合使用，單獨使用並不是特別有用"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfSheen.distribution
msgid "Sheen shading model"
msgstr "邊緣光澤著色模型"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfSheen.distribution:'ASHIKHMIN'
msgid "Ashikhmin"
msgstr "Ashikhmin"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfSheen.distribution:'ASHIKHMIN'
msgid "Classic Ashikhmin velvet (legacy model)"
msgstr "經典Ashikhmin絲絨（舊版模型）"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfSheen.distribution:'MICROFIBER'
msgid "Microfiber"
msgstr "Microfiber (超細纖維)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfSheen.distribution:'MICROFIBER'
msgid ""
"Microflake-based model of multiple scattering between normal-oriented fibers"
msgstr "基於Microflake的法線取向纖維間多重散射模型"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfToon
msgid "Toon BSDF"
msgstr "卡通 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfToon
msgid "Diffuse and Glossy shaders with cartoon light effects"
msgstr "具有卡通燈光效果的漫反射和光澤著色器"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfToon.component
msgid "Toon BSDF component to use"
msgstr "要使用的卡通BSDF分量"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfToon.component:'DIFFUSE'
msgid "Use diffuse BSDF"
msgstr "使用漫射 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfToon.component:'GLOSSY'
msgid "Use glossy BSDF"
msgstr "使用光澤 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfTranslucent
msgid "Translucent BSDF"
msgstr "半透 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfTranslucent
msgid "Lambertian diffuse transmission"
msgstr "Lambertian漫透射"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfTransparent
msgid "Transparent BSDF"
msgstr "透明 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBsdfTransparent
msgid ""
"Transparency without refraction, passing straight through the surface as if "
"there were no geometry"
msgstr "無折射的透明度，直接穿過表面，就好像不存在幾何體一樣"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBump
#. :src: bpy.types.PAINT_OT_add_texture_paint_slot.type:'BUMP'
#. :src: bpy.types.NWPrincipledPreferences.bump
msgid "Bump"
msgstr "凹凸"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBump
msgid ""
"Generate a perturbed normal from a height texture for bump mapping. "
"Typically used for faking highly detailed surfaces"
msgstr "從高度紋理生成擾動法向以用於凹凸貼圖。通常用於偽造高細節表面"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeBump.invert
msgid ""
"Invert the bump mapping direction to push into the surface instead of out"
msgstr "反轉凹凸對映方向，將其推入表面而不是推出表面"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeCameraData
msgid "Camera Data"
msgstr "攝像機資料"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeCameraData
msgid ""
"Retrieve information about the camera and how it relates to the current "
"shading point's position"
msgstr "檢索有關攝像機的資訊及其與當前著色點位置的關係"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeClamp
msgid "Clamp a value between a minimum and a maximum"
msgstr "將值鉗制在最小值和最大值之間"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeClamp.clamp_type
msgid "Clamp Type"
msgstr "鉗制型別"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeClamp.clamp_type:'MINMAX'
msgid "Min Max"
msgstr "最小/最大"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeClamp.clamp_type:'MINMAX'
msgid "Constrain value between min and max"
msgstr "最小值和最大值之間的約束值"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeClamp.clamp_type:'RANGE'
msgid "Constrain value between min and max, swapping arguments when min > max"
msgstr "最小值和最大值之間的約束值，當最小>最大值時交換引數"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeCombineColor
msgid "Create a color from individual components using multiple models"
msgstr "透過多種模型從單獨分量建立顏色"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeCombineXYZ
msgid "Combine XYZ"
msgstr "合併 XYZ"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeCombineXYZ
msgid "Create a vector from X, Y, and Z components"
msgstr "從 X、Y 和 Z 分量建立向量"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeCustomGroup
msgid "Shader Custom Group"
msgstr "著色器自定義組"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeCustomGroup
msgid "Custom Shader Group Node for Python nodes"
msgstr "Python 節點的自定義著色器組節點"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeDisplacement
msgid "Displace the surface along the surface normal"
msgstr "沿表面法線置換表面"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeDisplacement.space
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeVectorDisplacement.space
msgid "Space of the input height"
msgstr "輸入高度空間"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeDisplacement.space:'OBJECT'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeNormalMap.space:'OBJECT'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeVectorDisplacement.space:'OBJECT'
#. :src: Socket name from node group Displace Hair Curves, file
#. procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Object Space"
msgstr "物體空間"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeDisplacement.space:'OBJECT'
msgid "Displacement is in object space, affected by object scale"
msgstr "在物體空間中置換，受物體縮放影響"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeDisplacement.space:'WORLD'
msgid "Displacement is in world space, not affected by object scale"
msgstr "在世界空間中置換，不受物體縮放影響"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeEeveeSpecular
msgid "Specular BSDF"
msgstr "高光 BSDF"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeEeveeSpecular
msgid ""
"Similar to the Principled BSDF node but uses the specular workflow instead "
"of metallic, which functions by specifying the facing (along normal) "
"reflection color. Energy is not conserved, so the result may not be "
"physically accurate"
msgstr ""
"與原理化BSDF節點類似，但使用高光反射工作流而不是金屬度，透過指定面向 (沿法線) 反射顏色來發揮作用。由於能量不守恆，結果可能在物理上不準確"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeEmission
msgid "Lambertian emission shader"
msgstr "Lambertian自發光著色器"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeFloatCurve
msgid "Float Curve"
msgstr "浮點曲線"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeFloatCurve
msgid "Map an input float to a curve and outputs a float value"
msgstr "將輸入浮點數對映到曲線並輸出浮點值"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeFresnel
#: scripts/startup/bl_ui/space_userpref.py:957
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_layer_weight.cc:18
msgid "Fresnel"
msgstr "菲涅爾"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeFresnel
msgid ""
"Produce a blending factor depending on the angle between the surface normal and the view direction using Fresnel equations.\n"
"Typically used for mixing reflections at grazing angles"
msgstr ""
"使用菲涅爾方程根據表面法向與檢視方向之間的角度生成混合係數。\n"
"通常用於在掠角混合反射"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeGamma
msgid "Apply a gamma correction"
msgstr "應用伽瑪校正"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeHairInfo
msgid "Curves Info"
msgstr "曲線資訊"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeHairInfo
msgid "Retrieve hair curve information"
msgstr "檢索毛髮曲線資訊"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeHoldout
msgid ""
"Create a \"hole\" in the image with zero alpha transparency, which is useful for compositing.\n"
"Note: the holdout shader can only create alpha when transparency is enabled in the film settings"
msgstr ""
"在影象中建立一個 Alpha 透明度為零的 “孔”，這對於合成非常有用。\n"
"注：當在膠片設定中啟用透明時，阻隔著色器只能建立 Alpha"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeInvert
msgid "Invert a color, producing a negative"
msgstr "反轉顏色，產生負片效果"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLayerWeight
msgid "Layer Weight"
msgstr "層權重"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLayerWeight
msgid ""
"Produce a blending factor depending on the angle between the surface normal and the view direction.\n"
"Typically used for layering shaders with the Mix Shader node"
msgstr ""
"根據表面法向與檢視方向之間的角度生成混合係數。\n"
"通常用於使用混合著色器節點對著色器進行分層"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightAccumulation
msgid "Light Accumulation"
msgstr "光照累積"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightAccumulation
msgid ""
"Adds the result of all the evaluated lights and stores each input into its respective Compositing Pass.\n"
"The combined result is computed as (Diffuse Light * Diffuse Color) + (Glossy Light * Glossy Color)"
msgstr ""
"將所有已計算光照的結果相加，並將每個輸入儲存到相應的合成通道中。\n"
"最終結果的計算方式為：(漫射光 * 漫射顏色) + (光澤光 * 光澤顏色)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightEvaluation
msgid "Light Evaluation"
msgstr "光照評估"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightEvaluation.mode
msgid "Defines parametrization of the light evaluation"
msgstr "定義光照評估的引數化設定"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightFalloff
msgid "Light Falloff"
msgstr "光線衰減"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightFalloff
msgid ""
"Manipulate how light intensity decreases over distance. Typically used for "
"non-physically-based effects; in reality light always falls off "
"quadratically"
msgstr "控制光強度如何隨距離而降低。通常用於非物理效應；在現實中，光總是以二次型衰減"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightInfo
msgid "Light Info"
msgstr "光照資訊"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightInfo
msgid ""
"Exposes physical properties of the light being evaluated and computes basic "
"information relative to the evaluation position"
msgstr "展示待解算光線的物理特性，並計算與解算位置相關的基本資訊"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightIterInternalInput
msgid "Light Iter Internal Input"
msgstr "光照迭代內部輸入"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightIterInternalOutput
msgid "Light Iter Internal Output"
msgstr "光照迭代內部輸出"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightPath
msgid "Light Path"
msgstr "光程"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeLightPath
msgid ""
"Retrieve the type of incoming ray for which the shader is being executed.\n"
"Typically used for non-physically-based tricks"
msgstr ""
"檢索著色器正在被執行的入射光線的型別。\n"
"通常用於非基於物理的技巧"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange
msgid "Map Range"
msgstr "對映範圍"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange
msgid "Remap a value from a range to a target range"
msgstr "將值重新對映到目標範圍"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.clamp
msgid "Clamp the result to the target range [To Min, To Max]"
msgstr "將結果鉗制在目標範圍 [到最小值，到最大值]"

# rblc
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.interpolation_type
#. :src: bpy.types.ANIM_OT_channels_bake.interpolation_type
msgid "Interpolation Type"
msgstr "插值型別"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.interpolation_type:'LINEAR'
msgid "Linear interpolation between From Min and From Max values"
msgstr "從最小值和從最大值之間的線性插值"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.interpolation_type:'STEPPED'
msgid "Stepped Linear"
msgstr "階梯線性"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.interpolation_type:'STEPPED'
msgid "Stepped linear interpolation between From Min and From Max values"
msgstr "從最小值和從最大值之間的步進線性插值"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.interpolation_type:'SMOOTHSTEP'
msgid "Smooth Step"
msgstr "平滑階躍"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.interpolation_type:'SMOOTHSTEP'
msgid "Smooth Hermite edge interpolation between From Min and From Max values"
msgstr "從最小值和從最大值之間的平滑埃爾米特邊緣插值"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.interpolation_type:'SMOOTHERSTEP'
msgid "Smoother Step"
msgstr "更平滑階躍"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapRange.interpolation_type:'SMOOTHERSTEP'
msgid ""
"Smoother Hermite edge interpolation between From Min and From Max values"
msgstr "從最小值和從最大值之間的更平滑的埃爾米特邊緣插值"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapping
msgid ""
"Transform the input vector by applying translation, rotation, and scale"
msgstr "透過應用平移、旋轉和縮放來變換輸入向量"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapping.vector_type
#. :src: bpy.types.TexMapping.vector_type
msgid "Type of vector that the mapping transforms"
msgstr "對映變換的向量型別"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapping.vector_type:'POINT'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeVectorTransform.vector_type:'POINT'
#. :src: bpy.types.TexMapping.vector_type:'POINT'
msgid "Transform a point"
msgstr "變換一個點"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapping.vector_type:'TEXTURE'
#. :src: bpy.types.TexMapping.vector_type:'TEXTURE'
msgid "Transform a texture by inverse mapping the texture coordinate"
msgstr "透過反向對映紋理座標對紋理進行變換"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapping.vector_type:'VECTOR'
#. :src: bpy.types.TexMapping.vector_type:'VECTOR'
msgid "Transform a direction vector (Location is ignored)"
msgstr "變換一個方向向量 (忽略位置)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMapping.vector_type:'NORMAL'
#. :src: bpy.types.TexMapping.vector_type:'NORMAL'
msgid "Transform a unit normal vector (Location is ignored)"
msgstr "變換一個單位法向向量 (忽略位置)"

#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeMath
msgid "Perform math operations"
msgstr "執行數學運算"

