msgid "Relink Constraints"
msgstr "重新連結約束"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.relink_constraints
msgid ""
"For constraints with names formed like 'base@bonename', use the part after "
"'@' as the new subtarget after all bones are created. Use '@CTRL', '@DEF' or"
" '@MCH' to simply replace the prefix"
msgstr ""
"約束名稱的形式比如 'base@bonename'，在所有骨骼建立後使用 '@' 後的部分作為新的子目標，使用 '@CTRL'、'@DEF' 或 "
"'@MCH' 簡單地替換字首"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.roll_alignment
msgid "Bone roll alignment"
msgstr "骨骼扭轉對齊"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.secondary_coll_refs
#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_secondary_coll_refs
msgid "Layers for the secondary controls to be on"
msgstr "要開啟的次級控制元件的層"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.secondary_layers_extra
msgid "Assign Secondary Collections"
msgstr "指定次要集合"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.segments
msgid "Limb Segments"
msgstr "肢體段數"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.segments
msgid "Number of limb segments"
msgstr "肢體的分段數量"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_end_controls
msgid "Extra End Controls"
msgstr "額外末端控制元件"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_end_controls
msgid "Number of extra spline control points attached to the end control"
msgstr "額外樣條曲線控制點的數量附加到末端控制元件"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_fk_controls
msgid "Generate an FK control chain for the tentacle"
msgstr "為觸手生成 FK 控制鏈"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_max_radius
msgid "Maximum Radius"
msgstr "最大半徑"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_max_radius
msgid "Maximum supported scale factor for the spline control bones"
msgstr "樣條曲線控制骨骼支援的最大縮放係數"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_mid_controls
msgid "Middle Controls"
msgstr "中間控制元件"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_mid_controls
msgid "Number of spline control points in the middle"
msgstr "中間的樣條線控制點數量"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_radius_scaling
msgid "Radius Scaling"
msgstr "半徑縮放"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_radius_scaling
msgid ""
"Allow scaling the spline control bones to affect the thickness via curve "
"radius"
msgstr "允許縮放樣條線控制骨骼以透過曲線半徑影響粗細"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_start_controls
msgid "Extra Start Controls"
msgstr "額外起始控制元件"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_start_controls
msgid "Number of extra spline control points attached to the start control"
msgstr "附加到起始控制元件的額外樣條線控制點的數量"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_stretch_control
msgid "Tip Control"
msgstr "末梢控制元件"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_stretch_control
msgid "How the stretching of the tentacle is controlled"
msgstr "如何控制觸手的延展"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_stretch_control:'FIT_CURVE'
msgid "Stretch To Fit"
msgstr "拉伸至匹配"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_stretch_control:'FIT_CURVE'
msgid "The tentacle stretches to fit the curve"
msgstr "觸手伸展以匹配曲線"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_stretch_control:'DIRECT_TIP'
msgid "Direct Tip Control"
msgstr "直接末端控制元件"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_stretch_control:'DIRECT_TIP'
msgid ""
"The last bone of the chain is directly controlled, like the hand in an IK "
"arm, and the middle stretches to reach it"
msgstr "鏈的最後一塊骨骼是直接控制的，就像 IK 手臂中的手一樣，中間部分會拉伸到它"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_stretch_control:'MANUAL_STRETCH'
msgid "Manual Squash & Stretch"
msgstr "手動擠壓和拉伸"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.sik_stretch_control:'MANUAL_STRETCH'
msgid "The tentacle scaling is manually controlled via twist controls."
msgstr "觸手縮放是透過扭曲控制來手動控制的."

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_anchor_hide
msgid "Suppress Control"
msgstr "抑制控制"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_anchor_hide
msgid ""
"Make the control bone a mechanism bone invisible to the user and only "
"affected by constraints"
msgstr "使控制骨骼成為使用者不可見且僅受約束影響的機構骨骼"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_connect_ends
msgid "Connect Matching Ends"
msgstr "連線匹配末端"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_connect_ends
msgid ""
"Create a smooth B-Bone transition if an end of the chain meets another chain"
" going in the same direction"
msgstr "如果鏈的一端與同一方向的另一條鏈相遇，則建立平滑的柔性骨骼過渡"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_connect_mirror
msgid "Connect With Mirror"
msgstr "與映象連線"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_connect_mirror
msgid ""
"Create a smooth B-Bone transition if an end of the chain meets its mirror"
msgstr "如果鏈的一端與其映象相交，則建立平滑的柔性骨骼過渡"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_connect_sharp_angle
msgid "Sharpen Corner"
msgstr "銳化拐角"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_connect_sharp_angle
msgid ""
"Create a mechanism to sharpen a connected corner when the angle is below "
"this value"
msgstr "當角度低於此值時，建立一個機制來銳化連線的拐角"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff
msgid "Control Falloff"
msgstr "控制衰減"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff
msgid ""
"Falloff curve coefficient: 0 is linear, and higher value is wider influence."
" Set to -10 to disable influence completely"
msgstr "衰減曲線係數：0 是線性，值越大影響越大。設定為 -10 可完全禁用影響"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_length
msgid "Falloff Along Chain Curve"
msgstr "沿鏈曲線衰減"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_length
msgid ""
"Falloff is computed along the curve of the chain, instead of projecting on "
"the axis connecting the start and end points"
msgstr "衰減是沿著鏈的曲線計算的，而不是投射在連線起點和終點的軸上"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_scale
msgid "Propagate Scale"
msgstr "傳導縮放"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_scale
msgid "Propagate scale from main controls throughout the chain"
msgstr "從整個鏈的主控制元件傳導縮放"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_spherical
msgid "Spherical Falloff"
msgstr "球形衰減"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_spherical
msgid "Falloff curve tries to form a circle at +1 instead of a parabola"
msgstr "衰減曲線試圖在 +1 處形成一個圓，而不是拋物線"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_to_controls
msgid "Propagate To Controls"
msgstr "傳導到控制元件"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_to_controls
msgid ""
"Expose scale and/or twist propagated to tweak controls to be seen as parent "
"motion by glue or other chains using Merge Parent Rotation And Scale. "
"Otherwise it is only propagated internally within this chain"
msgstr ""
"將 縮放 和/或 扭曲 透過粘合傳導至調整控制元件來將其視為父級運動，或者透過使用 “合併父級旋轉和縮放” 的其他鏈。否則，它只在該鏈內部傳導"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_twist
msgid "Propagate Twist"
msgstr "傳導扭曲"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_falloff_twist
msgid "Propagate twist from main controls throughout the chain"
msgstr "在整個鏈中傳導主控制元件的扭曲"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_pivot_pos
msgid "Middle Control Position"
msgstr "中間控制元件位置"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_pivot_pos
msgid "Position of the middle control, disabled if zero"
msgstr "中間控制元件的位置，零為關閉"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_priority
msgid "Chain Priority"
msgstr "鏈優先"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_priority
msgid "When merging controls, chains with higher priority always win"
msgstr "合併控制元件時，優先順序較高的鏈總是獲勝"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_use_reparent
msgid "Merge Parent Rotation And Scale"
msgstr "合併父級的旋轉和縮放"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_use_reparent
msgid ""
"When controls are merged into ones owned by other chains, include parent-"
"induced rotation/scale difference into handle motion. Otherwise only local "
"motion of the control bone is used"
msgstr "當控制元件合併到其他鏈所擁有的控制元件中時，請將父控制元件引起的旋轉/縮放差異包含在控制柄運動中，否則，僅使用控制骨骼的區域性運動"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_use_scale
msgid "Use Handle Scale"
msgstr "使用控制柄縮放"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_chain_use_scale
msgid "Use control scaling to scale the B-Bone"
msgstr "使用控制元件縮放來縮放柔性骨骼"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_control_orientation_bone
msgid "Orientation Bone"
msgstr "定向骨骼"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_control_orientation_bone
msgid "If set, control orientation is taken from the specified bone"
msgstr "如果設定，則使用指定骨骼來控制方向"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint
msgid "Add Constraint"
msgstr "新增約束"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint
msgid ""
"Add one of the common constraints linking the control to the tail target"
msgstr "新增一個通用約束，將控制元件連結到尾部目標"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint:'NONE'
msgid "No New Constraint"
msgstr "沒有新的約束"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint:'NONE'
msgid "Don't add new constraints"
msgstr "不新增新約束"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint:'COPY_LOCATION'
msgid "Copy Location (Local)"
msgstr "複製位置 (區域性)"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint:'COPY_LOCATION'
msgid ""
"Add a constraint to copy Local Location with Offset. If the owner and target"
" control rest orientations are different, the global movement direction will"
" change accordingly"
msgstr "新增約束以複製帶有偏移的 “區域性位置”，如果所有者和目標控制元件的靜止方向不同，則全域性移動方向將相應改變"

#. :src:
#. bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint:'COPY_LOCATION_OWNER'
msgid "Copy Location (Local, Owner Orientation)"
msgstr "複製位置 (區域性, 擁有者定向)"

#. :src:
#. bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint:'COPY_LOCATION_OWNER'
msgid ""
"Add a constraint to copy Local Location (Owner Orientation) with Offset. "
"Even if the owner and target controls have different rest orientations, the "
"global movement direction would be the same"
msgstr "新增一個約束來複制帶有偏移的區域性位置 (擁有者定向)，即使擁有者和目標控制元件的靜止方向不同，全域性運動方向也會相同"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_add_constraint_influence
msgid "Influence of the added constraint"
msgstr "新增的約束的影響"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_head_mode
msgid "Glue Mode"
msgstr "粘合模式"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_head_mode
msgid ""
"Specifies how the glue bone is rigged to the control at the bone head "
"location"
msgstr "指定如何將粘合骨骼繫結到骨骼頭位置的控制元件上"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_head_mode:'CHILD'
msgid "Child Of Control"
msgstr "控制元件子級"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_head_mode:'CHILD'
msgid "The glue bone becomes a child of the control bone"
msgstr "粘合骨骼成為控制元件骨骼的子骨骼"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_head_mode:'MIRROR'
msgid "Mirror Of Control"
msgstr "控制元件映象"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_head_mode:'MIRROR'
msgid ""
"The glue bone becomes a sibling of the control bone with Copy Transforms"
msgstr "使用 “複製變換”，粘合骨骼將成為控制骨骼的同級骨骼"

#. :src: bpy.types.RigifyParameters.skin_glue_head_mode:'REPARENT'
