msgstr "使用基於貼圖的景深的亮度閾值"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.clamp_surface_direct
msgid "Clamp Surface Direct"
msgstr "鉗制表面直接光"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.clamp_surface_direct
msgid ""
"If non-zero, the maximum value for lights contribution on a surface. Higher "
"values will be scaled down to avoid too much noise and slow convergence at "
"the cost of accuracy. Used by light objects."
msgstr "若為非零值，則代表在表面上燈光貢獻取最大值。較高的值將被按比例縮小，以避免產生過多的噪點以及緩慢的聚斂，代價是犧牲精確度。用於燈光物體。"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.clamp_surface_indirect
msgid "Clamp Surface Indirect"
msgstr "鉗制表面間接光"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.clamp_surface_indirect
msgid ""
"If non-zero, the maximum value for indirect lighting on surface. Higher "
"values will be scaled down to avoid too much noise and slow convergence at "
"the cost of accuracy. Used by ray-tracing and light-probes."
msgstr ""
"若為非零值，則代表在表面上間接光取最大值。較高的值將被按比例縮小，以避免產生過多的噪點以及緩慢的聚斂，代價是犧牲精確度。用於光線追蹤和光照探頭。"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.clamp_volume_direct
msgid "Clamp Volume Direct"
msgstr "鉗制體積直接光"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.clamp_volume_direct
msgid ""
"If non-zero, the maximum value for lights contribution in volumes. Higher "
"values will be scaled down to avoid too much noise and slow convergence at "
"the cost of accuracy. Used by light objects."
msgstr "若為非零值，則代表在體積內燈光貢獻取最大值。較高的值將被按比例縮小，以避免產生過多的噪點以及緩慢的聚斂，代價是犧牲精確度。用於燈光物體。"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.clamp_volume_indirect
msgid "Clamp Volume Indirect"
msgstr "鉗制體積間接光"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.clamp_volume_indirect
msgid ""
"If non-zero, the maximum value for indirect lighting in volumes. Higher "
"values will be scaled down to avoid too much noise and slow convergence at "
"the cost of accuracy. Used by light-probes."
msgstr "若為非零值，則代表在體積內間接光取最大值。較高的值將被按比例縮小，以避免產生過多的噪點以及緩慢的聚斂，代價是犧牲精確度。用於光照探頭。"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.direct_light_intensity
msgid "Direct Light Strength"
msgstr "直接光強度"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.direct_light_intensity
msgid "Scale the contribution of direct lighting"
msgstr "縮放直接光的貢獻"

