msgstr "偏移著色法向以減少自相交偽影"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_distance
msgid ""
"If non-zero, the maximum distance at which other surfaces will contribute to"
" the fast GI approximation"
msgstr "如果不為零，則表示其他表面對快速GI近似值有影響的最大距離"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_method:'AMBIENT_OCCLUSION_ONLY'
msgid "Use ambient occlusion instead of full global illumination"
msgstr "使用環境光遮蔽而非完整全域性照明"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_method:'GLOBAL_ILLUMINATION'
msgid "Global Illumination"
msgstr "全域性照明"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_method:'GLOBAL_ILLUMINATION'
msgid ""
"Compute global illumination taking into account light bouncing off "
"surrounding objects"
msgstr "計算全域性照明, 考慮周圍物體的反彈光線"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_quality
msgid "Trace Precision"
msgstr "追蹤精度"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_quality
