msgstr "控制快速GI照明的質量，更高的解析度使用更多的記憶體。"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_step_count
msgid "Step Count"
msgstr "步幅數"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_step_count
msgid "Amount of screen sample per GI ray"
msgstr "每條全域性照明射線的螢幕取樣數"

#. :src: bpy.types.SceneEEVEE.fast_gi_thickness_near
msgid ""
"Geometric thickness of the surfaces when computing fast GI and ambient "
"occlusion. Reduces light leaking and missing contact occlusion."
msgstr "計算快速GI和環境遮蔽時表面的幾何厚度，減少漏光和漏接遮蔽。"

