msgstr "為支援工具的編輯器啟用工具"

#. :src: bpy.types.Prefs.use_alt_click_leader
msgid "Alt Click Tool Prompt"
msgstr "Alt 點選工具提示"

#. :src: bpy.types.Prefs.use_alt_click_leader
msgid ""
"Tapping Alt (without pressing any other keys) shows a prompt in the status-"
"bar, prompting a second keystroke to activate the tool"
msgstr "點選 Alt（不按任何其他鍵）會在狀態列中顯示提示，提示第二次擊鍵以啟用該工具"

#. :src: bpy.types.Prefs.use_alt_cursor
msgid "Alt Cursor Access"
msgstr "Alt 遊標訪問"

#. :src: bpy.types.Prefs.use_alt_cursor
msgid ""
"Hold Alt-LMB to place the Cursor (instead of LMB), allows tools to activate on press instead of drag.\n"
"Incompatible with the input preference \"Emulate 3 Button Mouse\" when the \"Alt\" key is used"
msgstr ""
"按住 Alt-滑鼠左鍵 (而不是隻按左鍵) 放置遊標，允許工具在按下而非拖動時啟用。\n"
"使用 Alt 鍵時與輸入首選項 “模擬三鍵滑鼠” 不相容"

#. :src: bpy.types.Prefs.use_alt_navigation
msgid "Transform Navigation with Alt"
msgstr "用Alt導航變換"

#. :src: bpy.types.Prefs.use_alt_navigation
msgid ""
"During transformations, use Alt to navigate in the 3D View. Note that if "
"disabled, hotkeys for Proportional Editing, Automatic Constraints, and Auto "
"IK Chain Length will require holding Alt"
msgstr ""
"在變換操作期間，使用Alt來控制3D檢視，注意，如果禁用此項，“衰減編輯”、“自動約束” 和 “自動IK鏈長度” 的快捷鍵則需要按住Alt鍵"

#. :src: bpy.types.Prefs.use_alt_tool
msgid "Alt Tool Access"
msgstr "Alt 工具訪問"

