#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_alpha_over.cc:25
msgid "Over"
msgstr "覆蓋"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_alpha_over.cc:26
msgid ""
"The foreground goes over the background according to the alpha of the "
"foreground"
msgstr "前景會根據其 alpha 覆蓋背景"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_alpha_over.cc:30
msgid "Disjoint Over"
msgstr "分離覆蓋"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_alpha_over.cc:31
msgid ""
"The foreground goes over the background according to the alpha of the "
"foreground while assuming the background is being held out by the foreground"
msgstr "在假設背景由前景支撐的前提下，前景會根據其 alpha 值覆蓋背景"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_alpha_over.cc:36
msgid "Conjoint Over"
msgstr "聯合覆蓋"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_alpha_over.cc:37
msgid ""
"The foreground goes over the background according to the alpha of the "
"foreground but the foreground completely covers the background if it is more"
" opaque"
msgstr "前景會根據其 alpha 覆蓋背景，但如果前景的不透明度更高，則前景會完全覆蓋背景"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_alpha_over.cc:56
msgid "Straight Alpha"
msgstr "直通型 Alpha"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_alpha_over.cc:58
msgid ""
"Defines whether the foreground is in straight alpha form, which is necessary"
" to know for proper alpha compositing. Images in the compositor are in "
"premultiplied alpha form by default, so this should be false in most cases. "
"But if, and only if, the foreground was converted to straight alpha form for"
" some reason, this should be set to true"
msgstr ""
"定義前景是否為直通 alpha 形式，這對於正確的 alpha 合成非常必要。合成器中的影象預設為預乘 alpha "
"形式，因此在多數情況下應取值為假。但僅當前景因某種原因被轉換為直通 Alpha 時，才應將其設為真"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_anti_aliasing.cc:31
msgid "Contrast Limit"
msgstr "對比度限制"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_anti_aliasing.cc:38
msgid "Corner Rounding"
msgstr "拐角圓角"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_anti_aliasing.cc:28
msgid ""
"Specifies the threshold or sensitivity to edges. Lowering this value you "
"will be able to detect more edges at the expense of performance"
msgstr "指定邊緣的閾值或靈敏度。降低此值，您將能夠以犧牲效能為代價檢測到更多的邊緣"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_anti_aliasing.cc:34
msgid ""
"If there is an neighbor edge that has a Contrast Limit times bigger contrast"
" than current edge, current edge will be discarded. This allows to eliminate"
" spurious crossing edges"
msgstr "如果存在一條鄰邊，其對比度比當前邊大 對比度限制 的倍數，則當前邊將被捨棄。這可以消除虛假的交叉邊"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_anti_aliasing.cc:43
