msgstr "結果"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_depth_combine.cc:38
msgid ""
"Use the alpha of the first input as mixing factor and return the more opaque"
" alpha of the two inputs"
msgstr "使用第一個輸入的 alpha 作為混合係數，並返回兩個輸入中更不透明 alpha 的那個"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_depth_combine.cc:43
msgid ""
"Anti-alias the generated mask before combining for smoother boundaries at "
"the cost of more expensive processing"
msgstr "在合成前對生成的遮罩進行抗鋸齒，以獲得更平滑的邊界，但代價是需要更多的處理"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_despeckle.cc:42
msgid "Neighbor Threshold"
msgstr "臨近閾值"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_despeckle.cc:39
msgid ""
"Pixels are despeckled only if their color difference from the average color "
"of their neighbors exceeds this threshold"
msgstr "只有當畫素與鄰近畫素平均顏色的色差超過該閾值時，才會對畫素進行去斑處理"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_despeckle.cc:47
msgid ""
"Pixels are despeckled only if the number of pixels in their neighborhood "
"that are different exceed this ratio threshold relative to the total number "
"of neighbors. Neighbors are considered different if they exceed the color "
"threshold input"
msgstr "只有當畫素鄰域中不同畫素的數量相對於鄰域總數超過該比率閾值時，畫素才會被去斑。如果相鄰畫素的顏色超過了輸入的顏色閾值，就會被認為是不同的"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_difference_key.cc:23
msgid "Image 1"
msgstr "影象 1"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_difference_key.cc:24
msgid "Image 2"
msgstr "影象 2"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_difference_key.cc:30
msgid ""
"If the average color difference between the two images is less than this "
"threshold, it is keyed"
msgstr "如果兩幅影象之間的平均色差小於此閾值，則摳像"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_difference_key.cc:38
msgid ""
"If the average color difference between the two images is less than this "
"threshold, it is partially keyed, otherwise, it is not keyed"
msgstr "如果兩幅影象之間的平均色差小於此閾值，則部分摳像，否則不摳像"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_dilate_erode.cc:51
msgid "Falloff Size"
msgstr "衰減尺寸"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_dilate_erode.cc:44
msgid ""
"The size of dilation/erosion in pixels. Positive values dilates and negative"
" values erodes"
msgstr "以畫素為單位的膨脹/侵蝕大小。正值為膨脹，負值為侵蝕"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_dilate_erode.cc:56
msgid ""
"The size of the falloff from the edges in pixels. If less than two pixels, "
"the edges will be anti-aliased"
msgstr "邊緣衰減的大小，畫素單位。如果小於兩個畫素，將對邊緣進行抗鋸齒處理"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_directional_blur.cc:33
msgid ""
"The number of samples used to compute the blur. The more samples the "
"smoother the result, but at the expense of more compute time. The actual "
"number of samples is two to the power of this input, so it increases "
"exponentially"
msgstr "用於計算模糊的取樣數量。取樣越多，結果越平滑，但代價是計算時間更長。實際取樣數是該輸入的二次方，因此呈指數級增長"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_directional_blur.cc:43
msgid ""
"The position at which the transformations pivot around. Defined in "
"normalized coordinates, so 0 means lower left corner and 1 means upper right"
" corner of the image"
msgstr "變換軸心圍繞的位置。在規格化座標系中定義，因此0表示影象的左下角，1表示影象的右上角"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_directional_blur.cc:50
msgid "The amount of rotation that the blur spans"
msgstr "模糊範圍的旋轉量"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_directional_blur.cc:54
msgid "The amount of scaling that the blur spans"
msgstr "模糊範圍的縮放量"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_directional_blur.cc:63
msgid ""
"The amount of translation that the blur spans in the specified direction "
"relative to the size of the image. Negative values indicate translation in "
"the opposite direction"
msgstr "相對於影象大小，模糊在指定方向上跨越的平移量。負值表示反向平移"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_directional_blur.cc:69
msgid "The angle that defines the direction of the translation"
msgstr "定義變換方向的角度"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_distance_key.cc:22
msgid "RGB color space"
msgstr "RGB 色彩空間"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_distance_key.cc:23
msgid "YCbCr color space"
msgstr "YCbCr 色彩空間"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_distance_key.cc:47
msgid ""
"If the distance between the color and the key color in the given color space"
" is less than this threshold, it is keyed"
msgstr "如果給定顏色空間中顏色和關鍵色彩之間的色距小於此閾值，則進行摳像"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_distance_key.cc:55
msgid ""
"If the distance between the color and the key color in the given color space"
" is less than this threshold, it is partially keyed, otherwise, it is not "
"keyed"
msgstr "如果給定顏色空間中顏色和關鍵色彩之間的色距小於此閾值，則部分摳像，否則不摳像"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_double_edge_mask.cc:14
msgid "Outer Mask"
msgstr "外側遮罩"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_double_edge_mask.cc:19
msgid "Inner Mask"
msgstr "內側遮罩"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_double_edge_mask.cc:24
msgid "Image Edges"
msgstr "影象邊緣"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_double_edge_mask.cc:29
msgid "Only Inside Outer"
msgstr "僅限內外"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_double_edge_mask.cc:26
msgid ""
"The edges of the image that intersects the outer mask will be considered "
"edges of the outer mask. Otherwise, the outer mask will be considered open-"
"ended"
msgstr "與外側遮罩相交的影象邊緣將被視為外側遮罩邊緣。否則，外側遮罩將被視為開放式"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_double_edge_mask.cc:31
msgid ""
"Only edges of the inner mask that lie inside the outer mask will be "
"considered. Otherwise, all edges of the inner mask will be considered"
msgstr "僅會考慮位於外側遮罩內部的內側遮罩邊界。否則，將考慮內側遮罩的所有邊界"

