msgid "Light Adaptation"
msgstr "光適應"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_tone_map.cc:97
msgid "Chromatic Adaptation"
msgstr "色適應"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_tone_map.cc:59
msgid ""
"The luminance that will be mapped to the log average luminance, typically "
"set to the middle gray value"
msgstr "將被對映到對數平均亮度的亮度值，通常設定為中灰值"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_tone_map.cc:66
msgid ""
"Balances low and high luminance areas. Lower values emphasize details in "
"shadows, while higher values compress highlights more smoothly"
msgstr "平衡低亮度和高亮度區域。較低的值會強調陰影中的細節，而較高的值則更平滑地壓縮高光"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_tone_map.cc:73
