msgstr "色調對映後應用的伽瑪校正係數"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_tone_map.cc:78
msgid ""
"Controls the intensity of the image, lower values makes it darker while "
"higher values makes it lighter"
msgstr "控制影象的強度，值越低，影象越暗，值越高，影象越亮"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_tone_map.cc:85
msgid ""
"Controls the contrast of the image. Zero automatically sets the contrast "
"based on its global range for better luminance distribution"
msgstr "控制影象的對比度。0 為根據其全域性範圍自動設定對比度，以獲得更好的亮度分佈"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_tone_map.cc:94
msgid ""
"Specifies if tone mapping operates on the entire image or per pixel, 0 means"
" the entire image, 1 means it is per pixel, and values in between blends "
"between both"
msgstr "指定色調對映是對整個影象還是對每個畫素進行操作，0 表示整個影象，1 表示每個畫素，介於兩者之間的值為混合在一起"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_tone_map.cc:103
msgid ""
"Specifies if tone mapping operates on the luminance or on each channel "
"independently, 0 means it uses luminance, 1 means it is per channel, and "
"values in between blends between both"
msgstr "指定色調對映是在亮度上操作還是在每個通道上獨立操作，0 表示它使用亮度，1 表示它是每個通道，介於兩者之間的值為混合在一起"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_track_position.cc:36
