#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_glass.cc:40
msgid ""
"Amount of anisotropy for specular reflection. Higher absolute values give "
"elongated highlights along the tangent direction"
msgstr "鏡面反射的各向異性量，較高的絕對值會沿切線方向產生細長的高光"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_glass.cc:48
