msgstr "黑色素紅"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:94
msgid "Radial Roughness"
msgstr "徑向粗糙度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:100
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:242
msgid "Coat"
msgstr "塗層"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:128
msgid "Random Color"
msgstr "隨機色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:135
msgid "Random Roughness"
msgstr "隨機糙度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:161
msgid "Secondary Reflection"
msgstr "二次反射"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:47
msgid "The RGB color of the strand. Only used in Direct Coloring"
msgstr "毛髮線的RGB顏色, 僅用於直接著色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:54
msgid "Hair pigment. Specify its absolute quantity between 0 and 1"
msgstr "毛髮色素。指定其介於0和1之間的絕對量"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:61
msgid ""
"Fraction of pheomelanin in melanin, gives yellowish to reddish color, as "
"opposed to the brownish to black color of eumelanin"
msgstr "黑色素中的一部分褐黑色素，與真黑色素的褐色到黑色相反，呈現黃色到紅色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:67
msgid "Additional color used for dyeing the hair"
msgstr "用於染髮的附加顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:73
msgid ""
"Specifies energy absorption per unit length as light passes through the "
"hair. A higher value leads to a darker color"
msgstr "指定光穿過毛髮時每單位長度的能量吸收。值越高，顏色越深"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:82
msgid ""
"The ratio of the minor axis to the major axis of an elliptical cross-"
"section. Recommended values are 0.8~1 for Asian hair, 0.65~0.9 for Caucasian"
" hair, 0.5~0.65 for African hair. The major axis is aligned with the curve "
"normal, which is not supported in particle hair"
msgstr ""
"橢圓截面的短軸與長軸之比，亞洲頭髮的推薦值為0.8~1，高加索為0.65~0.9，非洲為0.5~0.65，長軸與曲線法線對齊，這在粒子頭髮中不受支援"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:93
msgid "Hair roughness. A low value leads to a metallic look"
msgstr "毛髮糙度，低值會產生金屬外觀"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:105
msgid ""
"Simulate a shiny coat by reducing the roughness to the given factor only for"
" the first light bounce (diffuse). Range [0, 1] is equivalent to a reduction"
" of [0%, 100%] of the original roughness"
msgstr "透過將粗糙度降低來模擬有光澤的塗層，僅針對第一次燈光反彈 (漫反射)，範圍 [0, 1] 等效於原始粗糙度的 [0%, 100%]"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:114
msgid ""
"Index of refraction determines how much the ray is bent. At 1.0 rays pass "
"straight through like in a transparent material; higher values cause larger "
"deflection in angle. Default value is 1.55 (the IOR of keratin)"
msgstr "折射率決定光線彎曲的程度，1.0 時射線像在透明材質中一樣直接穿過，值越高角度偏轉越大，預設值是 1.55 (角質蛋白折射率)"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:125
msgid ""
"The tilt angle of the cuticle scales (the outermost part of the hair). They "
"are always tilted towards the hair root. The value is usually between 2 and "
"4 for human hair"
msgstr "角質層鱗片（毛髮最外層）的傾斜角度，它們總是向髮根傾斜，人類頭髮的值通常在2到4之間"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:133
msgid "Vary the melanin concentration for each strand"
msgstr "改變每根線的黑色素濃度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:140
msgid "Vary roughness values for each strand"
msgstr "每條線的粗糙度值各不相同"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:148
msgid ""
"Optional factor for modulating the first light bounce off the hair surface. "
"The color of this component is always white. Keep this 1.0 for physical "
"correctness"
msgstr "用於調製毛髮表面的第一個燈光反彈的可選系數，此組成部分的顏色始終為白色。為了物理正確性，請保持1.0"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:157
msgid ""
"Optional factor for modulating the transmission component. Picks up the "
"color of the pigment inside the hair. Keep this 1.0 for physical correctness"
msgstr "調節透射部分的可選系數，拾取毛髮內部色素的顏色，為了物理正確性，請保持1.0"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_hair_principled.cc:166
msgid ""
"Optional factor for modulating the component which is transmitted into the "
"hair, reflected off the backside of the hair and then transmitted out of the"
" hair. This component is oriented approximately around the incoming "
"direction, and picks up the color of the pigment inside the hair. Keep this "
"1.0 for physical correctness"
msgstr ""
"用於調節透射到毛髮中的光線的可選系數，從毛髮的背面反射並透射出毛髮，並拾取毛髮內部顏料的顏色，光線大致圍繞入射方向定向，為了物理正確性，請保持1.0"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_metallic.cc:31
msgid "Edge Tint"
msgstr "邊緣染色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_metallic.cc:42
msgid "Extinction"
msgstr "消光"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_metallic.cc:29
msgid "Color of the material"
msgstr "材質的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_metallic.cc:33
msgid ""
"Tint reflection at near-grazing incidence to simulate complex index of "
"refraction"
msgstr "在掠入射附近位置進行反射染色，模擬複合折射率"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_metallic.cc:40
msgid "Real part of the conductor's refractive index, often called n"
msgstr "導體折射率的實部，通常稱為n"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_metallic.cc:46
msgid "Imaginary part of the conductor's refractive index, often called k"
msgstr "導體折射率的虛部，通常稱為k"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_metallic.cc:53
msgid ""
"Microfacet roughness of the surface (0.0 is a perfect mirror reflection, 1.0"
" is completely rough)"
msgstr "表面的微表面粗糙度（0.0表示完美鏡面反射，1.0表示完全粗糙）"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_metallic.cc:61
msgid ""
"Amount of anisotropy for reflection. Higher values give elongated highlights"
" along the tangent direction"
msgstr "反射的各向異性量，較高的值會沿切線方向產生細長的高光"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:80
msgid "Thin Wall"
msgstr "薄壁"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:93
msgid "Diffuse Roughness"
msgstr "漫射粗糙度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:115
msgid "Subsurface Weight"
msgstr "次表面權重"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:125
msgid "Subsurface Radius"
msgstr "次表面半徑"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:133
msgid "Subsurface Scale"
msgstr "次表面縮放"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:142
msgid "Subsurface IOR"
msgstr "次表面折射率IOR"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:151
msgid "Subsurface Anisotropy"
msgstr "次表面各向異性"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:204
msgid "Anisotropic Rotation"
msgstr "各向異性旋轉"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:218
msgid "Transmission Weight"
msgstr "透射權重"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:226
msgid "Transmission Dispersion Scale"
msgstr "透射色散縮放"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:233
msgid "Transmission Dispersion Abbe Number"
msgstr "透射色散阿貝數"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:243
msgid "Coat Weight"
msgstr "塗層權重"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:253
msgid "Coat Roughness"
msgstr "塗層糙度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:261
msgid "Coat IOR"
msgstr "塗層折射率(IOR)"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:279
msgid "Coat Normal"
msgstr "塗層法向"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:284
msgid "Sheen Weight"
msgstr "邊緣光澤權重"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:293
msgid "Sheen Roughness"
msgstr "邊緣光澤糙度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:312
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_volume_principled.cc:39
msgid "Emission Color"
msgstr "自發光顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:186
msgctxt "NodeTree"
msgid "Specular Tint"
msgstr "高光染色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:270
msgctxt "NodeTree"
msgid "Coat Tint"
msgstr "塗層染色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:303
msgctxt "NodeTree"
msgid "Sheen Tint"
msgstr "邊緣光澤染色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:317
msgctxt "Amount"
msgid "Emission Strength"
msgstr "自發光強度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:41
msgid ""
"Color of the material used for diffuse, subsurface, metallic and "
"transmission"
msgstr "材質的顏色，用於漫反射、次表面、金屬度和透射"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:49
msgid ""
"Blends between a dielectric and metallic material model. At 0.0 the material"
" consists of a diffuse or transmissive base layer, with a specular "
"reflection layer on top. A value of 1.0 gives a fully specular reflection "
"tinted with the base color, without diffuse reflection or transmission"
msgstr ""
"絕緣體和金屬材質模型之間混合，0.0時，材質由漫反射或透射基礎層組成，頂部有高光反射層。值為1.0時，會產生完全鏡面反射，並使用基本顏色著色，而不會產生漫反射或透射"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:60
msgid ""
"Specifies microfacet roughness of the surface for specular reflection and "
"transmission (0.0 is a perfect mirror reflection, 1.0 is completely rough)"
msgstr "指定用於高光反射和透射表面的微平面粗糙度（0.0表示完美鏡面反射，1.0表示完全粗糙）"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:68
msgid ""
"Index of Refraction (IOR) for specular reflection and transmission. For most"
" materials, the IOR is between 1.0 (vacuum and air) and 4.0 (germanium). The"
" default value of 1.5 is a good approximation for glass"
msgstr ""
"高光反射和透射的折射率（IOR）。對於大多數材質，IOR介於1.0（真空和空氣）和4.0（鍺金屬）之間。預設值1.5是玻璃的一個很好的近似值"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:78
msgid "Controls the transparency of the surface, with 1.0 fully opaque"
msgstr "控制表面的透明度，取值 1.0 表示完全不透明"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:82
msgid ""
"A thin structure with the same material on both sides, useful for modeling "
"thin objects such as window, papers and leaves"
msgstr "一種兩面材質相同的薄型結構，適用於建模窗戶、紙張和樹葉等薄物"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:98
msgid ""
"Specifies microfacet roughness of the diffuse base (0.0 is perfect "
"lambertian reflection, 1.0 is completely rough)"
msgstr "指定漫反射基底的微平面粗糙度（0.0表示完美lambertian反射，1.0表示完全粗糙）"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:121
msgid ""
"Blend between diffuse surface and subsurface scattering. Typically should be"
" zero or one (either fully diffuse or subsurface)"
msgstr "漫反射表面和次表面散射之間的混合。通常應為0或1（完全漫反射或次表面）"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:130
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_subsurface_scattering.cc:36
msgid "Scattering radius per color channel (RGB), multiplied with Scale"
msgstr "每個顏色通道（RGB）的散射半徑，乘以縮放"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:139
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_subsurface_scattering.cc:31
msgid "Scale factor of the subsurface scattering radius"
msgstr "次表面散射半徑的縮放係數"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:148
msgid ""
"Index of Refraction (IOR) used for rays that enter the subsurface component"
msgstr "用於進入次表面的光線的折射率(IOR)"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:157
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_subsurface_scattering.cc:52
msgid ""
"Directionality of volume scattering within the subsurface medium. Zero "
"scatters uniformly in all directions, positive values scatter more in the "
"forward direction, and negative values scatter more backwards. For example, "
"skin has been measured to have an anisotropy of 0.8"
msgstr ""
"次表面介質內體積散射的方向性。零值表示向各個方向均勻散射，正值表示向前方向散射更多，負值表示向後方向散射更多。例如，測量表明皮膚的各向異性係數為 0.8"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:181
msgid ""
"Adjustment to the Index of Refraction (IOR) to increase or decrease specular"
" intensity (0.5 means no adjustment, 0 removes all reflections, 1 doubles "
"them at normal incidence)"
msgstr "調整折射率（IOR）以增加或減少高光強度（0.5表示無調整，0刪除所有高光反射，1在法線入射時使高光反射加倍）"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:189
msgid ""
"Tint dielectric reflection at normal incidence for artistic control, and "
"metallic reflection at near-grazing incidence to simulate complex index of "
"refraction"
msgstr "使用正入射時的染色介電反射，以實現藝術控制，而在接近斜入射時使用金屬反射，以模擬複雜的折射率"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:200
msgid ""
"Amount of anisotropy for specular reflection. Higher values give elongated "
"highlights along the tangent direction"
msgstr "鏡面反射的各向異性量，較高的值會沿切線方向產生細長的高光"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:213
msgid "Controls the tangent direction for anisotropy"
msgstr "控制各向異性的切向"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:224
msgid "Blend between transmission and other base layer components"
msgstr "混合透射和其它基礎層元件"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:231
msgid "Linearly scales the amount of dispersion"
msgstr "線性縮放色散程度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:237
msgid ""
"Abbe number of the base dielectric medium. Smaller number gives stronger "
"dispersion"
msgstr "基底介電介質的阿貝數。數值越小，色散越強"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:249
msgid ""
"Controls the intensity of the coat layer, both the reflection and the "
"tinting. Typically should be zero or one for physically-based materials"
msgstr "控制塗層的強度，包括反射和染色。對於基於物理的材質，通常應為0或1"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:259
msgid "The roughness of the coat layer"
msgstr "塗層糙度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:266
msgid ""
"The Index of Refraction (IOR) of the coat layer (affects its reflectivity as"
" well as the falloff of coat tinting)"
msgstr "塗層的折射率 (IOR)（影響其反射率以及塗層染色的衰減）"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:273
msgid ""
"Adds a colored tint to the coat layer by modeling absorption in the layer. "
"Saturation increases at shallower angles, as the light travels farther "
"through the medium (depending on the Coat IOR)"
msgstr "透過建立一個吸收層，給塗層新增一個帶顏色的染色，隨著光在介質中傳播得更遠 (取決於塗層IOR)，在較淺的角度飽和度增加"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:290
msgid ""
"Intensity of the sheen layer, which simulates very small fibers on the "
"surface"
msgstr "邊緣光澤層的強度，模擬表面的細小纖維質感"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:299
msgid ""
"Roughness of the sheen layer. Low and high roughness values produce fuzzy or"
" dusty appearance, respectively"
msgstr "邊緣光澤層的粗糙度，低粗糙度和高粗糙度分別會產生模糊和多塵的效果"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:307
msgid "Color of the sheen reflection"
msgstr "邊緣反射的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:315
msgid "Color of light emission from the surface"
msgstr "表面發射光的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:322
msgid ""
"Strength of the emitted light. A value of 1.0 ensures that the object in the"
" image has the exact same color as the Emission Color"
msgstr "發射光的強度，值為1.0可確保影象中的物件具有與 “發射顏色” 完全相同的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:180
msgid "IOR Level"
msgstr "折射率(IOR)等級"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:104
msgid "Subsurface"
msgstr "次表面"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:283
msgid "Sheen"
msgstr "邊緣光澤"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:188
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bsdf_principled.cc:272
msgctxt "NodeTree"
msgid "Tint"
msgstr "染色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bump.cc:27
msgid ""
"Strength of the bump mapping effect, interpolating between no bump mapping "
"and full bump mapping"
msgstr "凹凸貼圖效果的強度，在無凹凸貼圖和完全凹凸貼圖之間進行插值"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bump.cc:36
msgid ""
"Multiplier for the height value to control the overall distance for bump "
"mapping"
msgstr "用於控制凹凸貼圖的總體距離的高度值的倍增"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bump.cc:44
msgid ""
"Filter width in pixels, used to compute the bump mapping direction. For most"
" textures the default value of 0.1 enables subpixel filtering for stable "
"results. For stepwise textures a larger filter width can be used to get a "
"bevel like effect on the edges"
msgstr ""
"過濾寬度, 以畫素為單位, 用於計算凹凸貼圖的方向. 對於多數紋理, 預設值 0.1 即可實現子畫素過濾, 獲得穩定的效果; 對於階梯狀紋理, "
"可以使用更大的寬度來獲得類似倒角的邊緣效果"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_bump.cc:54
msgid "Height above surface. Connect the height map texture to this input"
msgstr "表面之上的高度. 請將高度貼圖紋理連線到此輸入端"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_camera.cc:16
msgid "View Vector"
msgstr "檢視向量"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_camera.cc:17
msgid "View Z Depth"
msgstr "Z 向檢視深度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_camera.cc:18
msgid "View Distance"
msgstr "檢視距離"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_color_ramp.cc:31
msgid ""
"The value used to map onto the color gradient. 0.0 results in the leftmost "
"color, while 1.0 results in the rightmost"
msgstr "用於對映到顏色漸變的值。0.0產生最左邊的顏色，而1.0產生最右邊的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_curves.cc:31
msgid "Amount of influence the node exerts on the output vector"
msgstr "節點施加給輸出向量的影響程度"

