msgid "Mortar"
msgstr "灰泥"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:56
msgid "Mortar Size"
msgstr "灰泥尺寸"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:64
msgid "Mortar Smooth"
msgstr "灰泥平滑"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:80
#: source/blender/nodes/texture/nodes/node_texture_bricks.cc:23
msgid "Brick Width"
msgstr "磚寬度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:86
#: source/blender/nodes/texture/nodes/node_texture_bricks.cc:24
msgid "Row Height"
msgstr "行高度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:42
msgid "Color of the first reference brick"
msgstr "第一個參考磚塊的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:45
msgid "Color of the second reference brick"
msgstr "第二個參考磚塊的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:49
msgid "Color of the area between bricks"
msgstr "磚塊間區域的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:55
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_magic.cc:36
msgid "Scale of the texture"
msgstr "紋理的縮放比例"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:61
msgid ""
"Size of the filling between the bricks (known as \"mortar\"). 0 means no "
"mortar"
msgstr "磚塊之間填充 (稱為 “灰泥”) 的大小。0 表示沒有灰泥"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:69
msgid ""
"Blurs/softens the edge between the mortar and the bricks. This can be useful"
" with a texture and displacement textures"
msgstr "模糊/柔化灰泥和磚塊之間的邊緣。這對紋理和置換紋理非常有用"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:76
msgid ""
"The color variation between Color1 and Color2. Values of -1 and 1 only use "
"one of the two colors. Values in between mix the colors"
msgstr "顏色 1 和顏色 2 之間的變化。取值 -1 和 1 表示只使用兩種顏色中的一種。介於兩者之間的值會混合兩種顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:85
msgid "Ratio of brick's width relative to the texture scale"
msgstr "磚塊的寬度相對於紋理縮放值的比率"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_brick.cc:91
msgid "Ratio of brick's row height relative to the texture scale"
msgstr "磚塊的行高相對於紋理縮放值的比率"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_checker.cc:34
msgid "Color of the first checker"
msgstr "第一個棋盤格的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_checker.cc:37
msgid "Color of the second checker"
msgstr "第二個棋盤格的顏色"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_checker.cc:43
msgid ""
"Overall texture scale.\n"
"The scale is a factor of the bounding box of the face divided by the Scale value"
msgstr ""
"整體紋理縮放.\n"
"此縮放為面邊界框除以 “縮放” 值的係數"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:38
msgid ""
"The coordinates at which Gabor noise will be evaluated. The Z component is "
"ignored in the 2D case"
msgstr "計算Gabor噪波的座標，在2D情況下忽略Z分量"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:44
msgid "The scale of the Gabor noise"
msgstr "Gabor 噪波的縮放"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:48
msgid ""
"The rate at which the Gabor noise changes across space. This is different "
"from the Scale input in that it only scales perpendicular to the Gabor noise"
" direction"
msgstr "Gabor 噪波在空間中變化的速率，這與 “縮放” 輸入不同，因為它僅垂直於 Gabor 噪波方向縮放"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:56
msgid ""
"The directionality of Gabor noise. 1 means the noise is completely "
"directional, while 0 means the noise is omnidirectional"
msgstr "Gabor噪波的方向，1表示噪聲是完全定向，而0表示噪聲是全方向"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:66
#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:71
msgid "The direction of the anisotropic Gabor noise"
msgstr "各向異性Gabor噪波的方向"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:74
msgid ""
"The Gabor noise value with both random intensity and phase. This is equal to"
" sine the phase multiplied by the intensity"
msgstr "具有隨機強度和相位的Gabor噪波值，這等於正弦相位乘以強度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:78
msgid "The phase of the Gabor noise, which has no random intensity"
msgstr "Gabor噪波的相位，不包含隨機強度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_gabor.cc:80
msgid "The intensity of the Gabor noise, which has no random phase"
msgstr "Gabor噪波的強度，不包含隨機相位"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_noise.cc:54
msgid "Scale of the base noise octave"
msgstr "基礎噪波倍波程的縮放"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_noise.cc:59
msgid ""
"The number of noise octaves. Higher values give more detailed noise but "
"increase render time"
msgstr "噪波倍波程數量，較高的值會產生更細節的噪波，但會增加算繪時間"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_noise.cc:68
msgid ""
"Blend factor between an octave and its previous one. A value of zero "
"corresponds to zero detail"
msgstr "一個倍波程與其前一個倍波程之間的混合因子。零值零細節"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_noise.cc:75
msgid ""
"The difference between the scale of each two consecutive octaves. Larger "
"values corresponds to larger scale for higher octaves"
msgstr "每兩個連續倍波程之間的差值。值越大，倍波程越大"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_noise.cc:88
msgid ""
"An added offset to each octave, determines the level where the highest "
"octave will appear"
msgstr "每個倍波程的附加偏移量，決定了最高倍波程出現的級別"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_noise.cc:97
msgid "An extra multiplier to tune the magnitude of octaves"
msgstr "一個額外的倍增器來調節倍波程的大小"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_voronoi.cc:60
msgid "The number of Voronoi layers to sum"
msgstr "沃羅諾伊層的數量總和"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_voronoi.cc:68
msgid ""
"The influence of a Voronoi layer relative to that of the previous layer"
msgstr "沃羅諾伊層相對於前一層的影響"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_voronoi.cc:75
msgid "The scale of a Voronoi layer relative to that of the previous layer"
msgstr "沃羅諾伊層相對於前一層的縮放值"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_wave.cc:52
msgid "Detail Scale"
msgstr "細節縮放"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_wave.cc:57
msgid "Detail Roughness"
msgstr "細節糙度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_wave.cc:41
msgid "Overall texture scale"
msgstr "整體紋理縮放"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_wave.cc:46
msgid "Amount of distortion of the wave"
msgstr "波浪的畸變程度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_wave.cc:51
msgid "Amount of distortion noise detail"
msgstr "噪波細節的畸變程度"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_wave.cc:56
