msgstr "在更平滑的噪波模式和更粗糙的尖銳峰值之間進行混合"

#: source/blender/nodes/shader/nodes/node_shader_tex_wave.cc:67
msgid ""
"Position of the wave along the Bands Direction.\n"
"This can be used as an input for more control over the distortion"
msgstr ""
"波的位置沿著頻帶方向.\n"
"這可以用於畸變上輸入更多的控制"

